<article class="story-page">
  <section class="story-chapter" id="our-story"><div class="story-chapter-copy"><p>There are moments in life that can never be repeated. Quiet moments. Intimate moments. The ones that change everything without asking for attention.</p><p>A first “yes.” A first child. A victory after a long journey. The moment you choose yourself. A love that needs no explanation. And the moment you finally understand who you are.</p><p>6Moments Jewelry was born from the belief that true value is never created instantly. It reveals itself over time, becoming part of a personal story — and eventually, part of a family legacy.</p></div><img src="{{ asset }}about-quote-jewelry.webp" alt="6MOMENTS jewelry"></section>
  <blockquote>Our jewelry is more than gold and diamonds. It is a symbol of a moment worth keeping forever.</blockquote>
  <section class="story-chapter" id="craft"><img src="{{ asset }}editorial/craftsmanship.webp" alt="Jeweler finishing a piece"><div class="story-chapter-copy"><h2>Thoughtfully made</h2><p>Every Six Moments piece is thoughtfully designed down to the smallest detail. From the first sketch to the final polish, our jewelry is created with precision, balance, and timeless elegance in mind.</p><p>We do not believe in mass production or conveyor-made luxury. Each piece is individually crafted, carefully inspected, and approved by professionals before it reaches you.</p><p>Our diamonds are selected for their brilliance and quality, with certified stones available for signature pieces. Every order is presented in luxury packaging designed to make the experience feel as meaningful as the jewelry itself.</p></div></section>
  <section class="story-manifesto"><p>Because true luxury is not simply brilliance.</p><p>It is memory. It is emotion. It is legacy.</p><strong>6 Moments Jewelry — where moments become legacy.</strong></section>
</article>
